      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BA706",
      "body": "ok, I was able to get it working per the comments i left on the gist.\r\n\r\nalso using opendns.com (free account) as a way to attempt to limit the domains that can be accessed over my limited hotspot data to only the needed ones (opendns, my SIM provider, and ntfy.sh). they dont seem to have a \"block everything\" option though so i just checked all the boxes and added special exceptions",
